      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年她好像终于要出道了呢！\n话说回来，她的气势还真是惊人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9196137515d3e9f155b5f35d288550443bee6447ba8492bb8aae04ecf57a331c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
