    {
      "uid": "zhcn:549c29ccc6b10441ab12e069",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──那开心而有力地\n蹬着地面奔跑的姿态，\n清楚展现了千明代表隐藏的才能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2089cad111a45fd51505ae8bdee59be02cf0862388f396f25d7c991ae6d4b839",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104100.json",
      "json_path": [
