      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我忍不住开始思考起，\n葛城王牌往后的道路\n将会是多么严苛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3012470475ef5eaf5c71ab3cae0e8a2675fce79dc92386889830401764b33dd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
